 "id": "218-19",
 "split": "screen_long",
 "sentences": [
  "Don't hesitate to reach out if you have any questions or if there's anything at all that I can assist with.",
  "My goal is to make your onboarding process as seamless as possible.",
  "When everyone takes responsibility for their tasks and decisions, we can drive better results.",
  "Ensure that everyone understands their objectives and key results.",
  "And with that clarity, we can encourage everyone to take ownership of their work.",
  "It's important to empower team members to make decisions and take initiative.",
  "Regular check-ins and feedback are also crucial.",
  "It's important to create a blameless environment where we can identify issues, own them, and work together to find solutions.",
  "When we view mistakes as opportunities to learn and improve, we can build a resilient and accountable team.",
  "Remember, accountability and ownership go hand in hand with trust and support.",
  "Let's continue to empower our team and drive success together.",
  "So, moving forward, I want you to use VSCode as your preferred IDE.",
  "It has some great features that will be beneficial for our work, especially with Python.",
  "Firstly, always use docstrings in your functions.",
  "They provide clarity and make your code more understandable for others, and even for yourself when you revisit the code.",
  "Also, don't forget to add comments to your code.",
  "Let's start by outlining the core functionalities and features you want this platform to have."
 ],
